# The Python packages the site is built with. make site installs
# docs/requirements.txt, which pins these and everything they need, each
# with its hashes. After changing this file, regenerate that one with
# pip-tools, from the top of the repository:
#
#     pip-compile --generate-hashes --strip-extras docs/requirements.in
#
# MkDocs stays at 1.6: Material for MkDocs does not support MkDocs 2.
